Has anyone had the game throw a curveball at you so you panic one second
and then feel stupid the next for feeling paniced?  I have:

I ate a fortune cookie, and it gave the regular message about reading the
note inside, the note said:

"You die! --more--"

Because I wan't paying attention, I panicked.  I hit space and it said
"unknown command ' '" (or something like that).  I laughed my ass off!
Kind of reminds me of the tricks the arcade game Gauntlet used to play on
you at super low levels.

